NOTE                          = "                                             
    RAD_RDR_2015_087_09_11_0939_V00.TXT contains one sol's worth              
    of all observations taken from the Mars Science Laboratory Radiation      
    Assessment Detector (RAD) for the mission elapsed sol 939.  This          
    file is in human readable ASCII form and the data have undergone          
    calibration and decompression from the binary MSL RAD EDR data."          
                                                                              
DESCRIPTION                   = "                                             
    This file contains data from RAD_RDR:  Radiation Assessment Detector      
    on the Mars Science Laboratory (MSL).  There is one sol's worth of        
    observations where each observation can have four types of data:          
    (1) Counters, (2) Histograms, (3) Dosimetry, and (4) PHA data.            
    These data are organized in a hierarchical fashion in which some          
    observations may not have all four types.  These are described in         
    the data object sections.  For additional information and details         
    concerning data organization, science meaning, etc., please refer         
    to the Data Set Catalog, MSLRAD_RDR_DS.CAT.                               
    "                                                                         
                                                                              
